<title>POLAND: Petrobank to name new Korean chief - paper.</title>
<headline>Petrobank to name new Korean chief - paper.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Petrobank SA will choose Dong-Soo Choi as new president while current head Boguslaw Grabowski will become deputy president, the daily Gazeta Wyborcza reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No one at Petrobank was available for comment.</p>
<p>South Korea's LG Securities Co Ltd, a unit of LG Group, has until November 7 to take up the 11,128,250 shares it agreed to buy last June at 12 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>The issue, already cleared for trade by the Polish Securities Commission, would give LG 50 percent plus one share of Petrobank. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
